{"id":"main_6_level_main_06-07_end","steps":[{"t":"cmd","c":"header","a":{"key":"title_test","is_skippable":true,"fit_mode":"BLACK_MASK"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"background","a":{"image":"bg_cher_11","width":1,"height":1,"fadetime":2}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playmusic","a":{"intro":"Sound_Beta_2/Music/beta2_180603/m_bat_qiecheng_intro","key":"Sound_Beta_2/Music/beta2_180603/m_bat_qiecheng_loop","volume":0.8,"crossfade":1.5,"delay":0.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":2}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_017_homura_3#6"}},{"t":"line","name":"Blaze","text":"*Pant* *pant*..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_017_homura_3#6","name2":"char_002_amiya_1#7","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"Blaze!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_017_homura_3#5","name2":"char_002_amiya_1#7","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Blaze","text":"I'm fine! They... have some moves."},{"t":"line","name":"Blaze","text":"You're not freezing, are you?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_017_homura_3#5","name2":"char_002_amiya_1#7","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"Thanks to you, we're okay. You're keeping the air warm enough to stop her chills."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_017_homura_3#5","name2":"char_002_amiya_1#7","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Blaze","text":"Don't mention it."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_017_homura_3#9"}},{"t":"line","name":"Blaze","text":"Hey Frosty, why aren't you using lethal Arts?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_1505_frstar_1#7"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":1,"xstrength":0,"ystrength":5,"vibrato":10,"randomness":10,"fadeout":true,"block":false}},{"t":"line","name":"FrostNova","text":"*Hack* *cough*..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_017_homura_3#5"}},{"t":"line","name":"Blaze","text":"......"},{"t":"line","name":"Blaze","text":"So that's why."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1#7"}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"...FrostNova, she..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_017_homura_3#5"}},{"t":"line","name":"Blaze","text":"FrostNova's the name?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_1505_frstar_1","name2":"avg_npc_037","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"FrostNova","text":"*Hack*... Help me... cover..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_1505_frstar_1","name2":"avg_npc_037","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Yeti Squad Member","text":"Sister..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_017_homura_3#5"}},{"t":"line","name":"Blaze","text":"Get out of here, Amiya. There could be more Reunion on the way. Do we have any injured? I can help."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_1505_frstar_1"}},{"t":"line","name":"FrostNova","text":"So you're retreating?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_017_homura_3#5","name2":"char_1505_frstar_1","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Blaze","text":"I'm going to politely suggest that you don't fight anymore, snow bunny."},{"t":"line","name":"Blaze","text":"If you keep using your Arts like that, you're going to die. You're just burning your life into power."},{"t":"line","name":"Blaze","text":"Or, you could always come to Rhodes Island. We've got ways to extend your life."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_017_homura_3#5","name2":"char_1505_frstar_1","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"FrostNova","text":"......"},{"t":"line","name":"FrostNova","text":"Don't look at me like that... I don't need your pity."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_017_homura_3#9","name2":"char_1505_frstar_1","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Blaze","text":"Do I look like I pity you? You're strong. I respect you."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_1505_frstar_1"}},{"t":"line","name":"FrostNova","text":"......"},{"t":"line","name":"FrostNova","text":"Why are you running away?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":1,"xstrength":10,"ystrength":12,"vibrato":30,"randomness":90,"fadeout":true,"block":false}},{"t":"line","name":"FrostNova","text":"*Cough*... *Hack* *hack*..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0.6,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_gen_soldiersrun","volume":0.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0.6,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_017_homura_3#6"}},{"t":"line","name":"Blaze","text":"Dr. {@nickname}, run. Don't look at her!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_219_meteo_1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Meteorite","text":"Reunion forces closing on our position!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0.6,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0.6,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_1505_frstar_1#9"}},{"t":"line","name":"FrostNova","text":"You're not leaving."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_1505_frstar_1#9","name2":"avg_npc_037","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Yeti Squad Member","text":"Sister, don't use that now, not where you're standing!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_1505_frstar_1#9","name2":"avg_npc_037","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"FrostNova","text":"We can't let them escape!"},{"t":"line","name":"FrostNova","text":"Who knows what Rhodes Island might do to our people in Lungmen!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_1505_frstar_1"}},{"t":"line","name":"FrostNova","text":"The temperature difference... it's causing the structure... to weaken!"},{"t":"line","name":"FrostNova","text":"*Cough* *cough*... freeze!"},{"t":"line","name":"FrostNova","text":"......♪......"},{"t":"line","name":"FrostNova","text":"*Hack*...!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_gen_surfacefrozen","volume":0.8}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":2}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_gen_surfacefrozen","volume":0.8}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_037"}},{"t":"line","name":"Yeti Squad Member","text":"It's working..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_gen_surfacefrozen","volume":0.8}},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":5,"xstrength":10,"ystrength":12,"vibrato":30,"randomness":90,"fadeout":true,"block":false}},{"t":"line","name":"Yeti Squad Member","text":"The Originium we buried has changed the structure of the lower levels, the plates are tilting!"},{"t":"line","name":"Yeti Squad Member","text":"Sister, it's too dangerous! Hold onto me!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_1505_frstar_1#7"}},{"t":"line","name":"FrostNova","text":"......"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_037"}},{"t":"line","name":"Yeti Squad Member","text":"Sister?!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":1,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":1,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_219_meteo_1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Meteorite","text":"...Blaze. Do you hear that?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_017_homura_3#5","name2":"char_219_meteo_1","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Blaze","text":"Hm?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_017_homura_3#5","name2":"char_219_meteo_1","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Meteorite","text":"Is that the sound of the structure shattering?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_017_homura_3#5","name2":"char_219_meteo_1","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Blaze","text":"Oh..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1#7"}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"Buried Originium... heat absorption... temperature difference..."},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"It's collapsing... FrostNova's Arts can actually do that...?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_017_homura_3#6"}},{"t":"line","name":"Blaze","text":"No!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0.6,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"image","a":{"image":"avg_6_16","x":0,"y":0,"xscale":1.1,"yscale":1.1,"fadetime":0}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"fadetime":0.6,"block":false}},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":10,"xstrength":10,"ystrength":12,"vibrato":30,"randomness":90,"fadeout":true,"block":false}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"imagetween","a":{"xscalefrom":1.1,"yscalefrom":1.1,"xscaleto":1,"yscaleto":1,"duration":15,"block":false}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_017_homura_3#4"}},{"t":"line","name":"Blaze","text":"The plate is warping!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_017_homura_3#4","name2":"char_219_meteo_1","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Meteorite","text":"Reunion is capable of something like this?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_017_homura_3#4","name2":"char_219_meteo_1","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Blaze","text":"All I know is... the whole district is sinking!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1#7"}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"Run! Get to a stable area! The ground here is caving in!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0.6,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"image","a":{"fadetime":0}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"fadetime":0.6,"block":false}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_259_Jessica_1#3"}},{"t":"line","name":"Jessica","text":"...Doctor?"},{"t":"line","name":"Jessica","text":"Doctor, the ground under you... it's... splitting?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_017_homura_3#6"}},{"t":"line","name":"Blaze","text":"Uh oh."},{"t":"line","name":"Blaze","text":"Dr. {@nickname}, move!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{}},{"t":"decision","options":["Move what...?"],"values":["1"]},{"t":"predicate","refs":["1"]},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":5,"xstrength":10,"ystrength":12,"vibrato":30,"randomness":90,"fadeout":false,"block":false}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1#7"}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"Doctor!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_017_homura_3#6"}},{"t":"line","name":"Blaze","text":"Amiya, stay where you are! Dr. {@nickname}, grab onto that lamppost!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1#7"}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"Save the Doctor!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_017_homura_3#6","name2":"char_002_amiya_1#7","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Blaze","text":"The ground is splitting too fast! I can't reach!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_017_homura_3#6","name2":"char_002_amiya_1#7","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"Then I'll do it!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_017_homura_3#6","name2":"char_002_amiya_1#7","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Blaze","text":"No!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_017_homura_3#6","name2":"char_002_amiya_1#7","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"What did——"},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{}},{"t":"decision","options":["...I'm okay."],"values":["1"]},{"t":"predicate","refs":["1"]},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1#7"}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"Doctor!!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_017_homura_3#6","name2":"char_219_meteo_1","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Meteorite","text":"The buildings can't support their own weight anymore, they're all collapsing!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_017_homura_3#6","name2":"char_219_meteo_1","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Blaze","text":"Meteorite, take her!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_017_homura_3#6","name2":"char_219_meteo_1","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Meteorite","text":"Okay, I've got Amiya!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1#7"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":1,"xstrength":10,"ystrength":12,"vibrato":30,"randomness":90,"fadeout":true,"block":false}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"Put me down!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_017_homura_3#9","name2":"char_002_amiya_1#7","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Blaze","text":"Amiya, go. I'll get the Doctor! I'm an elite operator, I can do it!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_017_homura_3#9","name2":"char_002_amiya_1#7","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"......"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_017_homura_3#9","name2":"char_002_amiya_1#7","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Blaze","text":"Welp, looks like we're not quite done."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_017_homura_3#6"}},{"t":"line","name":"Blaze","text":"Doctor, I'm going to use airflow and pressure to slow your fall and push away the building beside you. Don't worry, it won't crush you!"},{"t":"line","name":"Blaze","text":"Just don't panic! I've got you!"},{"t":"line","name":"Blaze","text":"...See you soon!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{}},{"t":"decision","options":["See you."],"values":["1"]},{"t":"predicate","refs":["1"]},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":3,"xstrength":8,"ystrength":6,"vibrato":30,"randomness":90,"fadeout":true,"block":false}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0.7,"r":0.95,"g":0.95,"b":0.95,"fadetime":0.02,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_sp_ballista"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0.95,"g":0.95,"b":0.95,"fadetime":0.25,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":3,"xstrength":8,"ystrength":6,"vibrato":30,"randomness":90,"fadeout":true,"block":false}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0.7,"r":0.95,"g":0.95,"b":0.95,"fadetime":0.02,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_sp_ballista"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"stopmusic","a":{"time":2}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":2,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":3,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playmusic","a":{"intro":"Sound_Beta_2/Music/beta1_180603/m_dia_mist_intro","key":"Sound_Beta_2/Music/beta1_180603/m_dia_mist_loop","volume":0.8,"crossfade":1.5,"delay":0.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_017_homura_3#5"}},{"t":"line","name":"Blaze","text":"......"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_037"}},{"t":"line","name":"Yeti Squad Member","text":"......"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_017_homura_3#9","name2":"avg_npc_037","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Blaze","text":"Sup? Where's FrostNova?"},{"t":"line","name":"Blaze","text":"Your commander fell down there too, huh?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_017_homura_3#9","name2":"avg_npc_037","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Yeti Squad Member","text":"...Yes."},{"t":"line","name":"Yeti Squad Member","text":"Could we not fight?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_037"}},{"t":"line","name":"Yeti Squad Member","text":"Rabbit of Rhodes Island, could we forge a temporary armistice? Honestly, we never much wanted to fight you."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_037","name2":"char_002_amiya_1#7","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"But..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_037","name2":"char_002_amiya_1#7","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Yeti Squad Member","text":"Mephisto told our sister you'd killed Alex, and she was very concerned about what you would do next."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_037","name2":"char_002_amiya_1#6","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"...Who's Alex?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_037","name2":"char_002_amiya_1#6","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Yeti Squad Member","text":"Skullshatterer."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_037","name2":"char_002_amiya_1#4","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"I'm sorry. I did kill Skullshatterer."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_037","name2":"char_002_amiya_1#4","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Yeti Squad Member","text":"...Oh."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_037","name2":"char_002_amiya_1#4","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"Infected really should not fight one another. I'm sorry."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_037","name2":"char_002_amiya_1#4","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Yeti Squad Member","text":"What's to apologize for? It was a battle, wasn't it?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_037","name2":"char_002_amiya_1#4","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"It was."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_037"}},{"t":"line","name":"Yeti Squad Member","text":"So let's have a ceasefire. Nesti, what do you say?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{}},{"t":"line","name":"Yeti Squad Member","text":"Huh? *Ursine profanity*!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_037","name2":"char_002_amiya_1#1","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Yeti Squad Member","text":"Nesti says he's fine with it."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_193_frostl_1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Frostleaf","text":"I don't think that's what he said."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_037","name2":"char_002_amiya_1#1","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Yeti Squad Member","text":"As long as we're not in battle, there's no reason to kill anyone, right?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_037","name2":"char_002_amiya_1#1","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"Why is it... you want a ceasefire?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_037","name2":"char_002_amiya_1#1","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Yeti Squad Member","text":"Did you ever notice that both our sides are led by rabbits?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_017_homura_3#6"}},{"t":"line","name":"Blaze","text":"...Huh?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_193_frostl_1#5"}},{"t":"line","name":"Frostleaf","text":"I think something in my brain just broke."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_193_frostl_1#5","name2":"char_259_Jessica_1#3","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Jessica","text":"Hm?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_193_frostl_1","name2":"char_259_Jessica_1#3","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Frostleaf","text":"These are the yetis of the ice field?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_193_frostl_1","name2":"char_259_Jessica_1#3","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Jessica","text":"Wh- what do you mean?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_193_frostl_1","name2":"char_259_Jessica_1#3","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Frostleaf","text":"Shouldn't they be cold, merciless killers?"},{"t":"line","name":"Frostleaf","text":"This isn't right."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_037"}},{"t":"line","name":"Yeti Squad Member","text":"That's prejudiced."},{"t":"line","name":"Yeti Squad Member","text":"Listen here, bunny."},{"t":"line","name":"Yeti Squad Member","text":"Who wins the battle, or where you go, none of that matters to us. All we care about is our sister's life."},{"t":"line","name":"Yeti Squad Member","text":"And you're worried about your friend too, right?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_037","name2":"char_002_amiya_1#7","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"...Right. We didn't come here to hurt anyone."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_037","name2":"char_002_amiya_1#7","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Yeti Squad Member","text":"You're definitely not here to hunt Reunion for sport, are you?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_037","name2":"char_002_amiya_1#7","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"Of course not!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_037","name2":"char_002_amiya_1#7","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Yeti Squad Member","text":"You know... it's funny..."},{"t":"line","name":"Yeti Squad Member","text":"If it weren't for Patriot insisting on unity in the Reunion Movement, we'd have dealt with Mephisto and his people a long time ago."},{"t":"line","name":"Yeti Squad Member","text":"And that'd be kinda like hunting Reunion for sport, huh?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_037","name2":"char_002_amiya_1","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"Huh..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"avg_npc_037","name2":"char_002_amiya_1","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Yeti Squad Member","text":"Let's get digging, shall we?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":0.6}},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"fadetime":2,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"image","a":{}}]}
